# Real credentials, never committed.
.env

# The repository root ignores `.env.*` and `.htaccess` everywhere. All three of
# the files below are part of THIS folder's deliverable, and two of them are
# what stop `src/`, `views/` and `.env` being downloaded when the folder is
# served as the document root - so they are re-included here.
!.env.example
!.htaccess
!public/.htaccess
